<item><title>Sierra Leone&apos;s vice presidency has never produced a president</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-s-vice-presidency-has-never-produced-a-b42fab/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-s-vice-presidency-has-never-produced-a-b42fab/</guid><category>Sierra Leone</category><description>Analyst Foday M. Daboh argues that the office is often used to balance factions rather than to groom successors, leaving holders without a clear path to power.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 08:57:42 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" length="34790" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Sierra Leone charcoal burning fuels deforestation</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-charcoal-burning-fuels-deforestation-a237a3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-charcoal-burning-fuels-deforestation-a237a3/</guid><category>Sierra Leone</category><description>The practice, driven by limited access to electricity and clean cooking, leads to environmental degradation and threatens food security.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 08:57:42 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-charcoal-burning-fuels-deforestation-a237a3/share.jpg" length="39829" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-charcoal-burning-fuels-deforestation-a237a3/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>UNFPA and Iceland fund fistula surgeries in Makeni and Bo</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/unfpa-and-iceland-fund-fistula-surgeries-in-makeni-and-bo-ecafa7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/unfpa-and-iceland-fund-fistula-surgeries-in-makeni-and-bo-ecafa7/</guid><category>Sierra Leone</category><description>About 10 women have already been operated on at Makeni Regional Hospital, and Bo Government Hospital is next in line for 10 to 15 more.</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:08:11 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" length="34790" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Sierra Leone&apos;s applause economy silences truth</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-s-applause-economy-silences-truth-afbd3b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sl/sierra-leone-s-applause-economy-silences-truth-afbd3b/</guid><category>Sierra Leone</category><description>Political loyalty is often mistaken for public service in Sierra Leone, with praise becoming a currency and silence the price for inclusion.</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 09:34:18 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" length="34790" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sl.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
